DOPE locked default Linux x86-64 native dependency notices
Inventory: normal/build Cargo packages and installed Rust library notices.
No GPU/research adapters or separately provisioned OS runtime are distributed here.
License texts retain upstream bytes; this inventory does not qualify a release.
