    <b>File/Directory:</b> <code>library/core/src/unicode/unicode_data.rs</code>
    </p>

    <p><b>License:</b> Unicode-3.0</p>
    
    <p><b>Copyright:</b> 1991-2024 Unicode, Inc</p>
    
</div>


    
    

